      4\nIn this section and section 2 below “benefit” means—\nza\nuniversal credit;\nzb\nstate pension
      or a lump sum under Part 1 of the Pensions Act 2014;\nzc\nbereavement support payment under section
      30 of the Pensions Act 2014;\na\nbenefit as defined in section 122 of the Contributions and Benefits
      Act;\naa\na jobseeker's allowance;\nab\nstate pension credit;\nac\nan employment and support allowance;
